Copyright (C) 2025-2026 Rolling Wireless S.a.r.l.

rolling_config is the firmware configuration service of this project.
It reads the per-OEM runtime configuration (rwwwanConfig.ini, shipped
under config_set/) and publishes it to the other rolling services.

