reproduced in "SECTION A: GNU LESSER GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE VERSION
2.1" of the top-level LICENSE file (kept verbatim in COPYING).

This directory ships the binary in executable form only: the
translation units it was built from are not published in this
repository.  Verify a redistributed copy against the digest below to
establish that it is unmodified.

    File                                            Size (bytes)  SHA-256
